			"notes": "## Added\n - **Block**: XP Drain, converts experience points from the player standing on top into _XP Juice_ and stores it in a tank sitting below\n - **Block**: XP Shower, converts _XP Juice_ - from the tank it's attached to - into experience orbs when a player is standing below it\n - **Fluid**: XP Juice, liquid representation of experience\n\n## Changed\n - **Block**: Rope ladders now expand into water instead of overwriting it with air.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/siasur/unrelatedadditions/compare/0.4.4-1.19...0.7.2-1.19"
